        "src": "/data/picturebooks/456281-praanigala-picnic/p05.jpg",
        "width": 639,
        "height": 689
      },
      "text": [
        "ಈಗ ತಿನ್ನುವುದು."
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
